{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00828","headline":"郊庙歌辞 周宗庙乐舞辞 福顺 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 周宗庙乐舞辞 福顺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新庙奕奕，金奏洋洋。\n享于祖考，循彼典章。\n清酤特满，嘉玉腾光。\n神醉既告，帝祉无疆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00828.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00828","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}